1. Added imports for the essential TipTap extensions: Document, Paragraph, and Text
2. Added import for the custom Reaction extension from @campsite/editor
3. Configured the editor with these required extensions

This should resolve the "Schema is missing its top node type ('doc')" error because we're now providing the Document extension which defines the 'doc' node type that TipTap requires as the root of its document schema.

The component will now render with all the necessary schema components while maintaining its original functionality. I've kept the component exactly as it is in the codebase, only fixing the editor configuration to make it work properly.

